# Release check for tiny-rust-lib

Dependencies are installed with `cargo fetch` and the tests run with `cargo test`.
See the [testing guide](https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/) and the [contributing notes](https://github.com/steplet-corpus/tiny-rust-lib/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).

Report the summary line exactly as printed.
